<title>CANADA: Natl Bank sets 1997 loan losses of C$225 mln.</title>
<headline>Natl Bank sets 1997 loan losses of C$225 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Bank of Canada said it set loan loss provisions for 1997 of C$225 million compared to C$235 million in 1996.</p>
<p>The bank said it set first quarter loan loss provisions at C$56.3 million compared to C$43.8 million in the first quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>The bank reported its loan loss provisions after delivering its first quarter earnings.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
</text>
